# Usage:
#   sudo ./deploy/sinbar-support-deploy \
#     /home/honoretm/sinbar-remote-support-main.zip
#
# SOURCE may be either:
#   - a GitHub "Download ZIP" archive of Honoretm76/sinbar-remote-support
#     after PR #1 has been merged; or
#   - a local checkout of that repository.
#
# The repository is private, so this script deliberately does not request,
# read, or store GitHub credentials. All four installers are downloaded from
# the official RustDesk 1.4.9 GitHub release and are accepted only after both
# their exact byte counts and SHA-256 digests match the reviewed release.

